   "type": "done",
   "answer": "根据当前课件，AMAT 的计算公式为：\n\n**AMAT = Hit Time + Miss rate × Miss Penalty** [S1][S2]\n\n代入题目数据：\n- Hit Time = 1 周期\n- Miss rate = 10% = 0.1\n- Miss Penalty = 300 周期\n\n**AMAT = 1 + 0.1 × 300 = 1 + 30 = 31 周期**\n\n课件第 27 页给出了完全相同的示例，结果一致：AMAT = 31 cycles [S1]。\n\n**PDF 物理页码：第 27 页**（公式与示例）；第 26 页也给出了 AMAT 公式定义 [S2]。",
   "citations": [
    {
     "document_id": "ad66f2c8360da43ea0981bffa549956185949044062a0abe4689381ced423402",
     "chunk_id": "ad66f2c8360da43ea0981bffa549956185949044062a0abe4689381ced423402-p27-1",
     "page": 27,
     "text": "CPU Memory Hierarchy\n\nMemory Hierarchy Performance\n\n\n      1 clk                                 300 clks\n                    First-level                                  Main\n               Cache                               Memory\n      Hit Time              Miss % * Miss penalty                                                  (DRAM)\n\n  Average Memory Access Time (AMAT)\n    = Hit Time + Miss rate * Miss Penalty\n    = Thit(L1) + Miss%(L1) * T(memory)\n  Example:\n    Cache Hit = 1 cycle\n    Miss rate = 10% = 0.1\n    Miss penalty = 300 cycles\n   AMAT = 1 + 0.1 * 300 = 31 cycles\n  Can we improve it?\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory    GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        27",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/ad66f2c8360da43ea0981bffa549956185949044062a0abe4689381ced423402/pages/27/preview",
     "source": "S1"
    },
    {
     "document_id": "ad66f2c8360da43ea0981bffa549956185949044062a0abe4689381ced423402",
     "chunk_id": "ad66f2c8360da43ea0981bffa549956185949044062a0abe4689381ced423402-p26-1",
     "page": 26,
     "text": "CPU Memory Hierarchy\n\nAverage Memory Access Time (AMAT)\n\n  AMAT = Hit time + Miss rate x Miss penalty\n  Miss Penalty: time to fetch a block from lower memory\n  level\n   Access Time: Latency for the memory to handle one access\n    Transfer Time: Latency to transfer data block to higher level\n   Miss penalty = access time + data size / bandwidth\n\n\n\n\n\n A cache helps when common hits remain fast and sufficiently few accesses pay\n▪\n  the miss penalty.\n\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory    GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        26",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/ad66f2c8360da43ea0981bffa549956185949044062a0abe4689381ced423402/pages/26/preview",
     "source": "S2"
    }
